  { "content": "打分公式为 0.5 内容 + 0.2 标签 + 0.15 关键词 + 0.15 图分，缺项按剩余权重归一。", "tags": ["architecture", "scoring"], "kind": "decision", "condition": "universal", "source": "index.ts" },
  { "content": "时间衰减按 0.5 的（天数/180）次方计算，pin 住的记忆不参与衰减。", "tags": ["architecture", "decay"], "kind": "decision", "condition": "记忆超过数周未更新时", "source": "index.ts" },

